---
description: Portfolio copywriting rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Tone:
- direct
- technical
- confident
- not inflated

Do not write like a generic AI portfolio.

Preferred positioning:
- backend-heavy full-stack
- system design mindset
- typed contracts
- API boundaries
- database schema
- reproducible setup
- verification/proof

Avoid:
- "passionate developer"
- "I love technology"
- "cutting-edge solutions"
- "seamless experiences"
- "innovative digital products"
